==Battleground==
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*30 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The Shadow Boxer Ks don't spawn until after a few of Those Guys have been defeated, so try to stall Those Guys for as long as possible at the beginning.

The use of most [[:Category:Single Attack Cats|Single Attack Cats]] such as [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Captain Cat]] or [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necromancer Cat]] is not recommended. Instead, use Area Attackers such as [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Angry Delinquent Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]].

Debuffers such as [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Avalokitesvara Cat]] are also helpful. The two Bun Buns can easily mow through your meatshields if you lack any ways of keeping them back. Prepare for a long battle, as the [[Bun Bun Black]] has '''1.55 million health!'''

